[{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/8219328184515","title":"We Are Getting Married — Wedding Planner","vendor":"The June Shop","status":"ACTIVE","productType":"Wedding Planners","descriptionHtml":"<p>Organise the celebrations with <strong>We Are Getting Married — Wedding Planner</strong>, a guided wedding planner for outfits, events, appointments, budgets and important details.</p><h3>What’s Inside</h3>\n<div dir=\"auto\">We have got you covered on:</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Basic planning aka wedding goals sheets, where you plan a rough sketch of what you want.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Trousseau shopping and packaging - consists of basic Trousseau checklist where you can also make additions. There is also a categorically Trousseau planning section where you can write list of things you need.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Grooming and salon appointments- to plan and schedule your salon appointments.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Self care schedule where you can set aside some days for yourself. </div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Bridesmaid and bachelorette party planning: invite, duties , defining their clothes, destination for bachelorette, theme, etc.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">• A letter from the groom and things you can look back when things get difficult.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">• Prewedding, save the date and wedding invite sheets for planning the pre-wedding tam jham.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Main Attires: outfit- makeup - accessory - groom outfit (Because, of course!)</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">In this you can plan attire’s for 6 ceremonies i.e wedding + 5 other main functions where you need to plan the in depth detailing of the attire. There is a rough ideating and the “this is it” page.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Plan of action (ceremony wise): there is wedding + 5 main functions’ in-depth function planning where you can plan the decor- menu- venue- guest list.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•To do lists to keep you on track.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Appointment and pickup schedule for 4 months.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Budget tracker to track every expense you are making.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Sticker sheets for fun.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Envelope to keep loose bills.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Pen loop</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Gold wire</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">•Hardbound</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Specs:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span>Material: Premium Paper (Hardbound Wiro)<br>Quantity: 1 Planner<br><span>No. of Pages: </span><span>62</span><span> pages / </span><span>124</span><span> sides<br></span>Planner Size - 23 cm (h) x 19cm (w)<br>Page Size - 21 cm (h) x 15 cm (w)<span><strong></strong></span></p>\n<h5></h5>\n<p>Country Of Origin: India</p>\n<p>Packed By: June Retail Private Limited<br>EN-22 Sector V Salt Lake Kolkata 700091 WB India</p>\n<div><br></div>","tags":["48201090","edit-keepsakes","edit-personal-gifts","edit-plan-what-matters","gst18","merch-core","Planners-Journals","stationery","stationery_","stationery_-planners","stationery_-planners-wedding-planners","Wedding-Planners","womens-day-collection"],"totalInventory":28,"featuredImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0177/5579/9606/files/3_f0c8327c-815c-46f1-80a5-18b83361886f.jpg?v=1759832663","images":[{"url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0177/5579/9606/files/3_f0c8327c-815c-46f1-80a5-18b83361886f.jpg?v=1759832663","altText":"","mediaId":"gid://shopify/MediaImage/36726364373187"},{"url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0177/5579/9606/files/3_c4cbeec6-2b11-4213-839b-02295c50efb4.jpg?v=1759834756","altText":"","mediaId":"gid://shopify/MediaImage/36726344319171"},{"url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0177/5579/9606/files/4_c3603bd2-d67d-4865-8cfa-2fd9613f253e.jpg?v=1759834756","altText":"","mediaId":"gid://shopify/MediaImage/36726344712387"},{"url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0177/5579/9606/files/5_9b79f2cd-fd0c-45ea-99cb-088582d9858c.jpg