e brief on Daddy &amp; Mummy. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A little family tree, with cute little info on the family for the baby to see &amp; learn. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shed light on how the world was like, when the baby was born.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Preserve the cuteness of the little one with hand &amp; foot prints. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tale of deciding the name. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Record every detail of the baby’s first homecoming. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jot down baby’s month-wise height, tooth &amp; weight in the chart. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pictures from the first photoshoot, first haircut, first little adventure. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Note the journey from 1st to 12th month, with pictures, things the baby learnt, what the baby loved doing, etc. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A loving letter from Mom &amp; Dad on every birthday till the 5th year. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Document every detail on the birthday of the little one till 5th year. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hilarious things the baby did. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Specs</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Material: High Quality Gloss Paper<br>Quantity: 1pcs<br>No of Pages: 40 pages / 80 Sides<br></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Country Of Origin: India</p>\n<p>Packed By: June Retail Private Limited<br>EN-22 Sector V Salt Lake Kolkata 700091 WB India</p>","tags":["48201020",